{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/006-pop-tops/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wood Times"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"ec4a9937-e38d-595c-9ba8-02146eff243c","excerpt":"The holidays were approaching, and I needed gift ideas. What better way to spread woodworking cheer than handmade bottle openers? Simple enough to batch produce…","html":"<p>The holidays were approaching, and I needed gift ideas. What better way to spread woodworking cheer than handmade bottle openers? Simple enough to batch produce, useful enough that people would actually use them, and a great excuse to practice some bandsaw curves.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/4228a07e942beafec41befa65d7f951b/669cd/blank_profile.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Blank Profile\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/4228a07e942beafec41befa65d7f951b/f058b/blank_profile.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/4228a07e942beafec41befa65d7f951b/c26ae/blank_profile.png 158w,\n/static/4228a07e942beafec41befa65d7f951b/6bdcf/blank_profile.png 315w,\n/static/4228a07e942beafec41befa65d7f951b/f058b/blank_profile.png 630w,\n/static/4228a07e942beafec41befa65d7f951b/40601/blank_profile.png 945w,\n/static/4228a07e942beafec41befa65d7f951b/78612/blank_profile.png 1260w,\n/static/4228a07e942beafec41befa65d7f951b/669cd/blank_profile.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The design was straightforward and right out of Nick Offerman’s book: an ergonomic S-curve that would feel natural in the hand. I figured out a template based on the dimensions and cut the profiles on the bandsaw. Oak seemed like the right choice for durability and that classic look.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/0b78795e47519cf64fe06b41ff5adb3a/493ac/drilled_pair.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Drilled Pair\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/0b78795e47519cf64fe06b41ff5adb3a/f058b/drilled_pair.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/0b78795e47519cf64fe06b41ff5adb3a/c26ae/drilled_pair.png 158w,\n/static/0b78795e47519cf64fe06b41ff5adb3a/6bdcf/drilled_pair.png 315w,\n/static/0b78795e47519cf64fe06b41ff5adb3a/f058b/drilled_pair.png 630w,\n/static/0b78795e47519cf64fe06b41ff5adb3a/40601/drilled_pair.png 945w,\n/static/0b78795e47519cf64fe06b41ff5adb3a/78612/drilled_pair.png 1260w,\n/static/0b78795e47519cf64fe06b41ff5adb3a/493ac/drilled_pair.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The business end required a forstner bit to create a recess for the bottle cap, plus a smaller hole for an old fashioned nail for the opening lever.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/8aac94725d17b5ddf46b6ae734e1ea93/493ac/hardware_installed.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Hardware Installed\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/8aac94725d17b5ddf46b6ae734e1ea93/f058b/hardware_installed.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/8aac94725d17b5ddf46b6ae734e1ea93/c26ae/hardware_installed.png 158w,\n/static/8aac94725d17b5ddf46b6ae734e1ea93/6bdcf/hardware_installed.png 315w,\n/static/8aac94725d17b5ddf46b6ae734e1ea93/f058b/hardware_installed.png 630w,\n/static/8aac94725d17b5ddf46b6ae734e1ea93/40601/hardware_installed.png 945w,\n/static/8aac94725d17b5ddf46b6ae734e1ea93/78612/hardware_installed.png 1260w,\n/static/8aac94725d17b5ddf46b6ae734e1ea93/493ac/hardware_installed.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>With the hardware test-fitted, I could see the design coming together.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/0dfb6975bc627caa1598ff856d09e672/669cd/finishing.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Finishing\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/0dfb6975bc627caa1598ff856d09e672/f058b/finishing.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/0dfb6975bc627caa1598ff856d09e672/c26ae/finishing.png 158w,\n/static/0dfb6975bc627caa1598ff856d09e672/6bdcf/finishing.png 315w,\n/static/0dfb6975bc627caa1598ff856d09e672/f058b/finishing.png 630w,\n/static/0dfb6975bc627caa1598ff856d09e672/40601/finishing.png 945w,\n/static/0dfb6975bc627caa1598ff856d09e672/78612/finishing.png 1260w,\n/static/0dfb6975bc627caa1598ff856d09e672/669cd/finishing.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>A few coats of satin finish brought out the grain and would protect against the inevitable beer splashes. Nothing fancy, these were meant to be used.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/bb8616bd7026c68031c2acd6c26142df/493ac/batch.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Batch\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/bb8616bd7026c68031c2acd6c26142df/f058b/batch.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/bb8616bd7026c68031c2acd6c26142df/c26ae/batch.png 158w,\n/static/bb8616bd7026c68031c2acd6c26142df/6bdcf/batch.png 315w,\n/static/bb8616bd7026c68031c2acd6c26142df/f058b/batch.png 630w,\n/static/bb8616bd7026c68031c2acd6c26142df/40601/batch.png 945w,\n/static/bb8616bd7026c68031c2acd6c26142df/78612/batch.png 1260w,\n/static/bb8616bd7026c68031c2acd6c26142df/493ac/batch.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Once I had the process dialed in, I could knock out a small batch fairly quickly. Each one was slightly unique thanks to variations in the grain pattern.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/dae7ca472bcbbe0290d9313735834b39/669cd/finished.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Finished\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/dae7ca472bcbbe0290d9313735834b39/f058b/finished.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/dae7ca472bcbbe0290d9313735834b39/c26ae/finished.png 158w,\n/static/dae7ca472bcbbe0290d9313735834b39/6bdcf/finished.png 315w,\n/static/dae7ca472bcbbe0290d9313735834b39/f058b/finished.png 630w,\n/static/dae7ca472bcbbe0290d9313735834b39/40601/finished.png 945w,\n/static/dae7ca472bcbbe0290d9313735834b39/78612/finished.png 1260w,\n/static/dae7ca472bcbbe0290d9313735834b39/669cd/finished.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The finished opener had a satisfying heft and a smooth feel in the hand. Pop tops became my go-to gift for the next few holiday seasons - practical, personal, and always appreciated by the craft beer enthusiasts in my life.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Pop Tops","date":"December 23, 2017","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/004-leading-cast-of-tools/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"The Leading Cast of Tools"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/007-shop-upgrade-part-1/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Shop Upgrade Part 1 - Walls and Storage"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"ec4a9937-e38d-595c-9ba8-02146eff243c","previousPostId":"9450d3aa-3503-5eb5-9cab-dded12214fdc","nextPostId":"0df9bcfa-e2c9-5e09-8d0e-21a0adc5e524"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383"],"slicesMap":{}}